{"seq":2,"slug":"damage-loss-tracking-quality","title":"破损丢件与轨迹质量指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/carrier-kpi-system/damage-loss-tracking-quality","wordCount":2065,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"破损丢件与轨迹质量指标\">破损丢件与轨迹质量指标</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时效指标衡量的是&quot;慢&quot;，质量指标衡量的是&quot;坏&quot;。这两者在绩效体系里常被合称为&quot;履约质量&quot;，但失败机制完全不同：慢是时间的连续偏差，坏是状态的离散跃变——一个包裹要么破损要么不破损，要么丢失要么在途，没有中间态。这个区别决定了统计方法不同：时效可以用均值和分位数描述，质量必须用比例和计数描述。</p>\n<p>跨境场景让质量指标变复杂的地方在于<strong>失败种类的划分</strong>。把&quot;包裹没能完好送达&quot;笼统统计成一个&quot;异常率&quot;，会让承运商无法得知该改进包装、改进交接、还是改进分拣；更糟的是，不同失败种类的前置原因与赔付责任完全不同，混在一起统计的比率既不能指导改进，也不能作为赔付依据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[未完好送达] --&gt; B{包裹是否存在}&#10;  B --&gt;|存在但损坏| C[破损]&#10;  B --&gt;|不存在| D{最后可见位置}&#10;  C --&gt; C1[外包装破损/内件损坏]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[受潮/污染/温度失控]&#10;  D --&gt;|有揽收无后续| E[全程丢失]&#10;  D --&gt;|有干线无派送| F[干线丢失]&#10;  D --&gt;|已派送未签收| G[末端丢失/误投]&#10;  D --&gt;|签收但非本人| H[错派]&#10;  A --&gt; I[短装: 多件票少到]\">graph TD\n  A[未完好送达] --&gt; B{包裹是否存在}\n  B --&gt;|存在但损坏| C[破损]\n  B --&gt;|不存在| D{最后可见位置}\n  C --&gt; C1[外包装破损/内件损坏]\n  C --&gt; C2[受潮/污染/温度失控]\n  D --&gt;|有揽收无后续| E[全程丢失]\n  D --&gt;|有干线无派送| F[干线丢失]\n  D --&gt;|已派送未签收| G[末端丢失/误投]\n  D --&gt;|签收但非本人| H[错派]\n  A --&gt; I[短装: 多件票少到]</pre><p>图中的每一片叶子都是独立的绩效指标，并且有各自的赔付口径。把它们压成一个数，是质量指标体系最先要避免的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类失败的定义与口径\">三类失败的定义与口径</h2><p><strong>破损必须区分包装与内件。</strong> 破损率的分子应该是&quot;内件受损&quot;的票数，而不是&quot;外包装受损&quot;的票数。外包装变形在跨境运输中极其常见（多次装卸、集装箱挤压），但绝大多数不影响内件；以外包装受损计数会把破损率放大数倍，并把承运商的关注点引向&quot;装箱方式&quot;而非真正的问题。可落地的采集方式是在签收数据里加一个三值字段（<code>none</code> / <code>packaging_only</code> / <code>content_damaged</code>），只在 <code>content_damaged</code> 时要求上传照片——既降低采集成本，也保证用于赔付的证据链。</p>\n<p><strong>丢失的判定要用规则而非时刻。</strong> 承运商倾向于尽早申报丢失以结案，客户倾向于尽可能久地等待。正确的做法是定义判定规则：包裹在超过 <code>$T_{lost}$</code> 小时没有新的轨迹事件，且最后一个事件属于&quot;在途&quot;类（而非&quot;已派送&quot;类），则判定为丢失。<code>$T_{lost}$</code> 不能是全局常数——跨太平洋海运的合理阈值是数周，同城派送是几天——应按运输方式分档设置，并在规则里显式记录该档位的依据。</p>\n<p><strong>短装与错派是最容易被忽略的两类。</strong> 短装指一票含多个包裹但到货数量不足；错派指包裹送达了错误地址或错误收件人。这两类发生率通常低，但对客户体验的破坏比破损更严重（错派往往意味着包裹彻底找不回）。它们的统计需要票与包裹两个粒度——破损率按票算，短装率按包裹算，因为一票里少一个包裹和少三个包裹的严重程度不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>典型赔付依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>破损率</td>\n<td>内件受损票数</td>\n<td>完成票数</td>\n<td>票</td>\n<td>申报货值 + 运费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全程丢失率</td>\n<td>判定丢失票数</td>\n<td>揽收票数</td>\n<td>票</td>\n<td>申报货值上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线丢失率</td>\n<td>干线后失踪票数</td>\n<td>到达干线票数</td>\n<td>票</td>\n<td>申报货值上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短装率</td>\n<td>少到包裹数</td>\n<td>应到包裹数</td>\n<td>包裹</td>\n<td>缺件货值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错派率</td>\n<td>错派票数</td>\n<td>派送票数</td>\n<td>票</td>\n<td>货值 + 补发成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索赔率</td>\n<td>已受理索赔票数</td>\n<td>完成票数</td>\n<td>票</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意最后一行：索赔率不是质量指标，而是<strong>客户感知指标</strong>。它可能高是因为质量问题多，也可能是因为索赔流程顺畅。把索赔率当作质量指标，等于把&quot;索赔流程做得好的承运商&quot;惩罚一遍。这些比率在进入记分卡前还要按线路归一，详见<a href=\"cost-lane-kpi-normalize\">按线路/市场的成本与质量归一</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轨迹事件质量-被忽视的第四类指标\">轨迹事件质量：被忽视的第四类指标</h2><p>轨迹事件质量是一个二阶指标——它不描述包裹，而描述<strong>关于包裹的数据</strong>。值得单独作为一个绩效维度，理由有两条：其一，它是其他所有指标的基础设施，时效达成率的分段归因依赖各段边界事件的可靠性，丢失判定依赖&quot;最后可见事件&quot;的准确性，承运商轨迹稀疏或时间戳错乱时，用它算出的时效和丢失率都不成立；其二，它直接影响客服成本，轨迹事件缺失时客户会联系客服，这部分成本由平台承担却由承运商的数据质量决定。</p>\n<p>轨迹质量可以分解为三个可测量的量：<strong>事件覆盖率</strong>（应有的里程碑事件中实际推送的比例）、<strong>推送时延</strong>（事件实际发生到推送到平台的间隔）、<strong>时间戳一致性</strong>（时间戳是否单调、是否与上下游事件矛盾）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 轨迹质量三指标：覆盖率 / 时延 / 单调性&#10;REQUIRED_EVENTS = [&quot;picked_up&quot;, &quot;export_cleared&quot;, &quot;linehaul_departed&quot;,&#10;                   &quot;import_cleared&quot;, &quot;out_for_delivery&quot;, &quot;delivered&quot;]&#10;&#10;def tracking_quality(events, now):&#10;    seen = {e[&quot;code&quot;] for e in events}&#10;    coverage = len(seen &amp; set(REQUIRED_EVENTS)) / len(REQUIRED_EVENTS)&#10;&#10;    delays = [e[&quot;received_at&quot;] - e[&quot;occurred_at&quot;] for e in events&#10;              if e.get(&quot;received_at&quot;) and e.get(&quot;occurred_at&quot;)]&#10;    p95_delay_h = sorted(delays)[int(0.95 * (len(delays) - 1))] / 3600 if delays else None&#10;&#10;    occ = [e[&quot;occurred_at&quot;] for e in events if e.get(&quot;occurred_at&quot;)]&#10;    inversions = sum(1 for a, b in zip(occ, occ[1:]) if b &lt; a)&#10;&#10;    return {&quot;coverage&quot;: round(coverage, 4), &quot;p95_delay_hours&quot;: p95_delay_h,&#10;            &quot;monotonicity_violations&quot;: inversions,&#10;            &quot;stale_hours&quot;: (now - max(occ, default=now)) / 3600}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 轨迹质量三指标：覆盖率 / 时延 / 单调性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRED_EVENTS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"picked_up\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"export_cleared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"linehaul_departed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                   \"import_cleared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"out_for_delivery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delivered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tracking_quality</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(events, now):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {e[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    coverage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRED_EVENTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRED_EVENTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    delays </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [e[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"received_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"occurred_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"received_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"occurred_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p95_delay_h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(delays)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.95</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(delays) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delays </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    occ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [e[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"occurred_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"occurred_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inversions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(occ, occ[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coverage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(coverage, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p95_delay_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p95_delay_h,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"monotonicity_violations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: inversions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"stale_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(occ, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">now)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>monotonicity_violations</code> 是一个强信号：正常情况下事件在时间轴上只能前进，出现逆序说明承运商的时间戳处理有系统性缺陷——常见于本地时区未转换，或批量补推历史事件时未保留原始发生时刻。这类缺陷与<a href=\"transit-sla-achievement\">时效达成与 SLA 指标</a>中讨论的时区内联要求是同一个问题的两个侧面。</p>\n<h3 id=\"轨迹质量的写入模型\">轨迹质量的写入模型</h3><p>三个指标都需要按票落库才能做承运商维度的聚合，结构上要能同时支持&quot;按票查询&quot;和&quot;按承运商用时间窗聚合&quot;两种访问模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE tracking_quality_daily (&#10;  carrier_id      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  lane_id         TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  stat_date       DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  shipments       INTEGER     NOT NULL,&#10;  coverage_sum    NUMERIC(12,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  delay_p95_hours NUMERIC(8,2),&#10;  mono_violations INTEGER     NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  undetermined    INTEGER     NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (carrier_id, lane_id, stat_date)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_tqd_carrier_window ON tracking_quality_daily (carrier_id, stat_date);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tracking_quality_daily</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lane_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stat_date       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipments       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  coverage_sum    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delay_p95_hours </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mono_violations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  undetermined    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (carrier_id, lane_id, stat_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_tqd_carrier_window</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracking_quality_daily (carrier_id, stat_date);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>按&quot;承运商 × 线路 × 天&quot;预聚合，而不是每次查询都扫明细，是因为轨迹质量要参与月度评分，而明细表通常按票分区、体量在亿级。<code>undetermined</code> 单列一栏，对应<a href=\"transit-sla-achievement\">时效达成与 SLA 指标</a>里&quot;数据缺失无法判定&quot;那一类票，它既是数据质量问题也是评分时的样本损失，必须可见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该用-cusum-而不是月度比率\">何时该用 CUSUM 而不是月度比率</h2><p>月度破损率是一个聚合数字，它会掩盖渐进恶化。承运商的破损率从 0.8% 缓慢爬升到 1.2%，按月看每个月的变动都在噪声范围内，直到某个月突然爆发才被发现——而此时已经积累了数月的损失。对<strong>持续性小幅偏移</strong>，控制图里合适的选择是 CUSUM（累积和），它累积偏离目标的证据而非逐点判断：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C*i^+ = \\max\\left[0,\\; x_i - (T + K) + C*{i-1}^+\\right], \\quad C*i^- = \\max\\left[0,\\; (T - K) - x_i + C*{i-1}^-\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>$T$</code> 是目标值，<code>$K$</code> 是参考值（松弛量，吸收正常波动），当 <code>$C_i^+$</code> 或 <code>$C_i^-$</code> 超过决策间隔 <code>$h$</code> 时报警。CUSUM 的设计检测目标是 <code>$1.5\\sigma$</code> 及以下的持续偏移，正好对应&quot;缓慢恶化&quot;这个场景（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CUSUM\">CUSUM 累积和控制图</a>）。</p>\n<p>与之相对的选择是 EWMA，它对当前值加权更重、对历史衰减更快，适合检测中等幅度偏移且更容易向业务方解释：<code>$z_i = \\lambda x_i + (1-\\lambda) z_{i-1}$</code>，<code>$\\lambda$</code> 常见取值 0.05 到 0.25，越大越贴近原始值、平滑越弱（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EWMA_chart\">指数加权移动平均控制图</a>）。实操建议两个都算：EWMA 用于看板展示的平滑曲线，CUSUM 用于触发告警——二者都不需要额外的数据管道，只是在既有时间序列上加一层计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>质量指标的失败机制是离散的，必须用比例与计数描述，不能用均值。</li>\n<li>破损率以&quot;内件受损&quot;为分子，外包装变形的票单独统计，否则会误导改进方向。</li>\n<li>丢失判定用&quot;超时无事件 + 最后事件属于在途类&quot;的规则，阈值按运输方式分档。</li>\n<li>破损按票算、短装按包裹算，粒度不同因为严重程度不同。</li>\n<li>索赔率是客户感知指标而非质量指标，混用会惩罚索赔流程顺畅的承运商。</li>\n<li>轨迹事件质量是独立维度，由覆盖率、推送时延、时间戳单调性三个量描述，需按承运商 × 线路 × 天预聚合。</li>\n<li>检测渐进恶化用 CUSUM，展示趋势用 EWMA，两者并存而不互斥。</li>\n<li>这些比率要在记分卡里可比，还须经<a href=\"cost-lane-kpi-normalize\">按线路/市场的成本与质量归一</a>处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"破损丢件与轨迹质量指标","id":"破损丢件与轨迹质量指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三类失败的定义与口径","id":"三类失败的定义与口径"},{"level":2,"text":"轨迹事件质量：被忽视的第四类指标","id":"轨迹事件质量-被忽视的第四类指标"},{"level":3,"text":"轨迹质量的写入模型","id":"轨迹质量的写入模型"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该用 CUSUM 而不是月度比率","id":"何时该用-cusum-而不是月度比率"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时效达成与 SLA 指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/carrier-kpi-system/transit-sla-achievement"},"next":{"title":"按线路/市场的成本与质量归一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/carrier-kpi-system/cost-lane-kpi-normalize"}}